Publish the page's media session to HarmonyOS AVSession.

The control center and lock screen show what a page is playing and send play,
pause, next, previous, stop and seek back to it. The implementation is
components/system_media_controls/ohos/ (overlay), on the OH_AVSession C API.

kHardwareMediaKeyHandling is what makes the browser create system media
controls at all, so it is enabled on OHOS. OHOS has no ui::MediaKeysListener
(the stub returns null), so if AVSession cannot be created the manager stays
without either instead of dereferencing a null listener.

Generated for Chromium 154.0.8037.51 after chromium-154-harmonyos.patch.

